<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Text/P 393 0 R/F 28/M(D:20240729202624Z00'00)/Contents(I don't think this top layout works for this content. I would explore different options for how you could lay this out. The white box just feels constricting for all that needs to be communicated in this top space. Would look at ways to bring the tie the title and sub text more closely together.)/C[.933333 .470588 .188235]/Popup 458 0 R/T(Emily Hardesty \(Credera\))/CA .4/CreationDate(D:20240729202624Z00'00)/Name/Comment/AP<</N 455 0 R>>/Rect[34.07098 642.0877 51.106473 659.12319]>>
